    <string name="settings_floating_description">Shows a movable, resizable, transparent teleprompter above other apps such as Samsung Camera. Start it for a script with \"Use with phone camera\" (script menu or prompter top bar). It follows your voice while the microphone is free and scrolls at the manual speed while the camera app records sound.</string>
