    <string name="about_title">About LensPrompt</string>
    <string name="about_tagline">A teleprompter that works over the camera you already use.</string>
    <string name="about_your_data">Your data</string>
    <string name="about_data_text">• Scripts and settings are stored on this phone. If Android backup is on, they are included in your device backup.\n• LensPrompt has no account, no ads and no analytics, and it does not upload your scripts, audio or video.\n• Smart Follow with an offline speech pack recognizes speech inside LensPrompt. Without a pack, your phone\'s speech recognition service (for example Google or Samsung) does it and may process audio online under that provider\'s terms.\n• Videos you record are saved to Movies/LensPrompt on this phone.\n• Offline speech packs are downloaded from alphacephei.com only when you ask.</string>
