    <string name="floating_title">Use with phone camera</string>
    <string name="floating_intro">A floating teleprompter stays on top of Samsung Camera, Google Camera, Instagram or any other camera app. Move it by the ⠿ handle, resize it from the bottom edge and corner, and use ⚙ for text size, speed and transparency.</string>
    <string name="floating_mic_note">Smart Follow listens with LensPrompt\'s microphone. If the camera app records video WITH sound, Android gives it the microphone and other apps hear silence; the teleprompter then scrolls at your manual speed and resumes following when the microphone is free.</string>
    <string name="floating_permission_note">First, allow LensPrompt to \"Display over other apps\" on the next screen, then come back.</string>
